    {
      "bbox": [
        474,
        1003,
        1346,
        1157
      ],
      "category": "Text",
      "text": "§ 3. All agencies are directed to assign top policy level personnel to assist in this effort when requested by the Council. In particular, the Commissioner of Sanitation, the Administrator of Environmental Protection, the Commissioner of Water Resources and the Commissioner of Ports and Terminals are requested to attend Council meetings as required, and work directly with the members to carry out the goals and objectives of building Westway under the overall direction of the First Deputy Mayor or his designated representative.\"",
